Vosk speech recognition models
https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models
Copyright Alpha Cephei Inc.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Two models are redistributed verbatim inside this application, as assets:

  app/src/main/assets/vosk-model-fr.zip  -> vosk-model-small-fr-0.22
  app/src/main/assets/vosk-model-en.zip  -> vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15

They are unmodified copies of the archives published at the URL above.
Bundling them rather than downloading them at runtime is what allows the
app to work without ever opening a network connection, and accounts for
most of its installed size.

